<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Standard raised at Laing.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Standard raised at Laing.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banking group Standard Chartered Plc was raised to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;sell&quot; at Credit Lyonnais Laing, dealers said on Friday.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>The stock was up 3-1/2 at 896.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
